---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Blog — Wire Mesh Guides, Sourcing Tips & Industry Insights"
  description="Practical guides for buying wire mesh: material selection, specifications, factory sourcing, and trade tips. Written for overseas B2B buyers."
  lang="en"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">MeshCalculator Blog</h1>
    <p class="text-theme-secondary text-lg mb-8">
      Practical wire mesh guides for overseas buyers. No fluff—just specifications, standards, and sourcing intelligence.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      <!-- Post 8 -->
      <article class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-theme-primary transition">
        <div class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-2">September 9, 2026 • Import Guide</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-2">
          <a href="/blog/how-to-import-wire-mesh-from-china/" class="hover:underline">
            How to Import Wire Mesh from China: Step-by-Step Guide
          </a>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
          The complete 7-step process for first-time importers: specs, factory verification, samples, Incoterms negotiation, safe payment, and shipping. Includes QC checklist, scam warnings, and landed-cost tools.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-2 text-xs">
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">importing</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">Anping</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">Incoterms</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Post 1 -->
      <article class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-theme-primary transition">
        <div class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-2">September 9, 2026 • Buying Guide</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-2">
          <a href="/blog/how-to-choose-wire-mesh-for-filtration/" class="hover:underline">
            How to Choose Wire Mesh for Industrial Filtration — Complete Buyer Guide
          </a>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
          Material selection (304 vs 316), mesh-to-micron conversion, weave types, ASTM standards, and application-specific recommendations. Includes spec tables and factory sourcing checklist.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-2 text-xs">
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">stainless steel</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">filtration</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">buying guide</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Post 2 -->
      <article class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-theme-primary transition">
        <div class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-2">September 9, 2026 • Technical Guide</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-2">
          <a href="/blog/wire-mesh-size-chart-explained/" class="hover:underline">
            Wire Mesh Size Chart Explained — Mesh Count vs Micron vs Wire Gauge
          </a>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
          Complete conversion tables for mesh count, micron rating, and wire gauge. Learn how open area affects flow rate and how to select the right mesh size for your application.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-2 text-xs">
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">mesh size</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">micron</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">conversion</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Post 3 -->
      <article class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-theme-primary transition">
        <div class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-2">September 9, 2026 • Industry Insight</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-2">
          <a href="/blog/anping-wire-mesh-cluster/" class="hover:underline">
            Anping Wire Mesh: Why 60% of China's Wire Mesh Comes From Here
          </a>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
          The story of the world's largest wire mesh cluster: 500+ factories, three quality tiers, and how to source from an Anping wire mesh factory without getting burned. Includes verification checklist and FAQ.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-2 text-xs">
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">Anping</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">sourcing</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">factory directory</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Post 4 -->
      <article class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-theme-primary transition">
        <div class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-2">September 9, 2026 • Technical Guide</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-2">
          <a href="/blog/how-to-calculate-wire-mesh-weight/" class="hover:underline">
            How to Calculate Wire Mesh Weight (With Formula)
          </a>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
          Plain weave and welded mesh weight formulas with worked examples in kg/m² and lb/ft². Includes density tables, unit conversions, and the common mistakes that throw off freight estimates.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-2 text-xs">
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">weight calculator</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">formula</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">shipping</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Post 5 -->
      <article class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-theme-primary transition">
        <div class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-2">September 9, 2026 • Buying Guide</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-2">
          <a href="/blog/welded-vs-woven-wire-mesh/" class="hover:underline">
            Welded vs Woven Wire Mesh: Which One Do You Need?
          </a>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
          Construction, opening ranges, strength, cost, and applications compared side-by-side. Includes spec tables, honest tradeoffs, and a checklist for ordering the right mesh type.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-2 text-xs">
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">welded mesh</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">woven mesh</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">buying guide</span>
        </div>
      </article>
    <!-- Post 6 -->
    <article class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-theme-primary transition">
      <div class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-2">September 9, 2026 • Technical Comparison</div>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-2">
        <a href="/blog/304-vs-316-stainless-steel-mesh/" class="hover:underline">
          Stainless Steel Wire Mesh 304 vs 316: Corrosion Resistance Test
        </a>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        Salt spray test data, chemical composition comparison, and cost analysis for 304 vs 316 stainless steel mesh. Includes application guide, identification methods, and FAQ.
      </p>
      <div class="flex gap-2 text-xs">
        <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">stainless steel</span>
        <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">corrosion</span>
        <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">comparison</span>
      </div>
    </article>
      <!-- Post 7 -->
      <article class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-theme-primary transition">
        <div class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-2">September 9, 2026 • Buying Guide</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-2">
          <a href="/blog/chain-link-vs-welded-fence-panels/" class="hover:underline">
            Chain Link Fence vs Welded Fence Panels: Cost Comparison
          </a>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
          Side-by-side cost comparison of chain link fence vs welded fence panels: material, installation, and 20-year maintenance costs, plus security levels, lifespan, application recommendations, and a decision checklist.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-2 text-xs">
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">chain link fence</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">welded fence panels</span>
          <span class="bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-20 text-theme-secondary px-2 py-1 rounded">cost comparison</span>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="mt-12 bg-theme-secondary bg-opacity-10 border border-theme rounded-lg p-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Need Help Sourcing Wire Mesh?</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-6">
        Send us your specifications. We'll connect you with verified factories in Anping, China.
      </p>
      <a href="/inquiry/" class="inline-block px-8 py-3 accent-bg text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition">
        Submit Inquiry
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
